{
  "name": "Send each finalized invoice PDF to the accounting mailbox",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Send each finalized invoice PDF to the accounting mailbox\n\nWhen LetzBill finalizes an invoice, this workflow downloads its PDF and emails it to your accounting mailbox.\n\n### Set up\n1. Install the community package `@altarys/n8n-nodes-letzbill`.\n2. Select a **LetzBill API** credential in both LetzBill nodes. The key needs **Read**, **Write**, and **Delete** for webhooks and **Read** for invoices.\n3. Select an SMTP credential in both email nodes.\n4. Change the addresses in **Settings**.\n5. Publish the workflow.\n\nThe download is retried three times. If it still fails, the second email names the invoice, so someone can send it by hand.\n\nGuide: https://github.com/helmajbri/altarys-n8n-nodes/blob/main/packages/letzbill/docs/examples.md",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "b3e5f7a9-002f-4000-8000-000000000030",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "invoice.finalized"
        ],
        "toleranceSeconds": 300
      },
      "id": "b3e5f7a9-0031-4000-8000-000000000032",
      "name": "LetzBill Trigger",
      "type": "@altarys/n8n-nodes-letzbill.letzBillTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b3e5f7a9-0033-4000-8000-000000000034",
              "name": "toEmail",
              "value": "accounting@example.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b3e5f7a9-0035-4000-8000-000000000036",
              "name": "fromEmail",
              "value": "n8n@example.com",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b3e5f7a9-0037-4000-8000-000000000038",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "invoice",
        "operation": "downloadPdf",
        "invoiceId": "={{ $('LetzBill Trigger').item.json.invoice.id }}"
      },
      "id": "b3e5f7a9-0039-4000-8000-00000000003a",
      "name": "Download invoice PDF",
      "type": "@altarys/n8n-nodes-letzbill.letzBill",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.fromEmail }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.toEmail }}",
        "subject": "=Invoice {{ $('LetzBill Trigger').item.json.invoice.invoice_number }}",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "=The finalized invoice is attached.",
        "options": {
          "fileAttachments": "data"
        }
      },
      "id": "b3e5f7a9-003b-4000-8000-00000000003c",
      "name": "Email the PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        700,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.fromEmail }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.toEmail }}",
        "subject": "=Invoice {{ $('LetzBill Trigger').item.json.invoice.invoice_number }}: PDF not downloaded",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "=The invoice was finalized, but its PDF could not be downloaded from LetzBill. Download it from the console and send it by hand.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b3e5f7a9-003d-4000-8000-00000000003e",
      "name": "Email that the PDF is missing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        700,
        120
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "LetzBill Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Settings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Settings": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download invoice PDF",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Download invoice PDF": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Email the PDF",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Email that the PDF is missing",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
